  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "跨領域畢業專題(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERDISCIPLINARY GRADUATION PROJECT(1)",
    "describe_ch": "以工業物聯網技術，開發無線傳感器機台蒐集並傳輸數據且儲存於雲端資料庫，後以AI技術分析機台作動特徵。並將異質機台特徵依製造流程特性，串接為產線製造特徵，然後以AI分析產線即時製造效率。以APP展現數據。",
    "describe_eh": "To solve the problem with concept of information/intelligence is the main trend. By applying Internet of Things, the wireless sensors are applied to capture the data, which can stored in cloud database. Therefore the characteristics of the phenomena can be analyzed by AI. The heterogeneous devices are connected in series of the system according to the characteristics of the process. Furthermore, the efficiency of the production line is analyzed and presented visually by AI and APP, respectfully.",
    "pre_subname": "BUS6000研究方法",
    "pre_sub_id3": "BUS6000",
    "pre_sub_ename": "BUS6000 RESEARCH METHODS",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
